  "description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"padding:2px 0px 0px;margin:18px 0px 0px;line-height:26px;font-weight:normal;font-size:15px;color:rgb(47,137,188);background-image:none;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left bottom;font-family:'Motiva Sans', sans-serif;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(27,40,56);\">Journey to an Ancient Kingdom of Insects & Heroes</h2><span style=\"color:rgb(172,178,184);font-family:'Motiva Sans', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(27,40,56);float:none;\">The Official Soundtrack for Hollow Knight captures the vast underground world of the game. The story begins with soft piano notes echoing the Hollow Knight theme and swells to orchestral scale as a kingdom's fate unfolds.</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(172,178,184);font-family:'Motiva Sans', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(27,40,56);\" /><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(172,178,184);font-family:'Motiva Sans', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(27,40,56);\" /><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-family:'Motiva Sans', sans-serif;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(172,178,184);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(27,40,56);\">The Hollow Knight Official Soundtrack</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(172,178,184);font-family:'Motiva Sans', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(27,40,56);float:none;\"><span> </span>is composed by Christopher Larkin.</span>",
